# Spec Kit infrastructure is tracked deliberately in this template: `.specify/`
# and `.github/skills/` are what seed the workflow in a derived repository, and
# they exist for the life of the project.
#
# Ignored instead are the artifacts that exist only while a repository is being
# onboarded or that belong to the machine rather than the project. The alignment
# run's spec.md, plan.md and tasks.md are working notes: they complete their
# purpose when alignment lands and are not carried forward.
/.specify/presets/
/.specify/extensions/.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
